        <obo:IAO_0000115>LHSR is a cell line in which human prostate epithelial cells (PrEC) were infected with amphotropic retroviruses encoding the SV40 large T antigen (L), the telomerase catalytic subunit hTERT (H), the SV40 small T antigen (S) and an oncogenic allele of H-ras (R) to create LHSR cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
