        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0004747"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A soluble transferrin receptor measurement  (sTfR) is a measure of the level of the Soluble transferrin receptor protein in blood as a measure of iron metabolism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Helen Parkinson</obo:IAO_0000117>
