        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0001444"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>quantification of copper in blood used in the diagnosis of Wilson&apos;s disease (in combination with ceruloplasmin measurement) or copper deficiences. Low levels may indicate Wilson&apos;s disease, high levels may indicate liver disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Dani Welter</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <efo:definition_citation>http://labtestsonline.org.uk/understanding/analytes/copper/</efo:definition_citation>
