        <obo:IAO_0000115>HuH-7 is a well differentiated hepatocyte derived cellular carcinoma cell line that was originally taken from a liver tumor in a 57-year-old Japanese male in 1982. The line was established by Nakabayshi, H. and Sato, J. HuH-7 is an immortal cell line of epithelial-like tumorigenic cells. It usually grow in 2D monolayers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <efo:definition_citation>http://cellbank.nibio.go.jp/legacy/celldata/jcrb0403.htm</efo:definition_citation>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0001950</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
