        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0001444"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Quantification of the fraction of nitric oxide in the total exhalation volume, used as a non-invasive biomarker of eosinophilic airway inflammation. Higher Feno values are associated with childhood asthma symptoms, exacerbations, physician-diagnosed asthma and atopy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
