        <obo:IAO_0000115>The line was derived from L3 wing discs (Ui et al., 1987). Transcriptome analysis suggests similarity to cells in the notal region, but not to adepithelial cells (Cherbas et al., 2011). Cells are also female, by criterion of Rox expression.</obo:IAO_0000115>
