        <obo:IAO_0000115>This S2 isolate is the one routinely used for RNAi screens at the DRSC; it is referred to at the DRSC as &quot;S2&quot;. Its relationship to the line we call &quot;S2&quot; (catalog #006) is not known.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>NCIt:C111071</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
