        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0009095"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A measurement of some aspect of psychological negative valence systems e.g. those responsible for responses to aversive situations or context, such as fear, anxiety and loss</obo:IAO_0000115>
