        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0006514"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Quantification of the amount of beta-secretase 1 in a sample, typicallly cerebrospinal fluid. Beta-secretase-1 is an aspartic-acid protease important in the formation of myelin sheaths in peripheral nerve cells, and is thought to have a role in Alzheimer&apos;s disease pathogenesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Laura Harris</obo:IAO_0000117>
