        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0803374"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A measurement of the ability of erythrocytes to change shape without rupturing, as they pass through narrow spaces, such as the microvasculature.</obo:IAO_0000115>
